{"displayStem":"기계환기 중인 환자에서 튜브 위치와 회로 누출은 정상이고 분당환기량·CO₂ 생성량은 일정하다. 그림의 각 점은 동시에 얻은 동맥혈과 호기말 CO₂ 모형값이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 작성 교육용 합성자료"},{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 교육용 모식도 · 합성자료","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C04 c04-batch\"><div class=\"evidence C04-vector\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 390\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"자료 12의 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"640\" height=\"390\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><text x=\"65\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\">CO₂ 분압 (mmHg)</text><path d=\"M75 65L75 290\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M75 290L580 290\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"190.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">40</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"85.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">80</text><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"325.0\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"575.0\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><polyline points=\"75.0,185.0 325.0,164.0 575.0,132.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polyline><circle cx=\"75.0\" cy=\"185.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"325.0\" cy=\"164.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><ci